BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:egmond105kmvenicebase-w1-s0-long@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260909T190549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
SUMMARY:▲ Long easy run 6 km\, HR under 155. Aerobic base…
DESCRIPTION:Long easy run 6 km\, HR under 155. Aerobic base is the lever 
 - the fastest runners get there on Zone 1 volume.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 - Re-e
 ntry\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nRE-ENTRY. Vertical
  jump stays depressed ~18 days after an ultra\, so this is easy running 
 and nothing else. Durability is the through-line of the whole block: lon
 g sessions over 90 min are what preserve running economy under fatigue\,
  which is the 70.3 run leg in one sentence.\n56 days to Egmond 10.5 km /
  Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:egmond105kmvenicebase-w1-s1-swim@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260909T190549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
SUMMARY:≈ Swim 30 min
DESCRIPTION:Swim 30 min - TECHNIQUE ONLY. Breathing\, body position\, cat
 ch. Distance is irrelevant for six weeks.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 - Re-entry\nRE
 -ENTRY. Vertical jump stays depressed ~18 days after an ultra\, so this 
 is easy running and nothing else. Durability is the through-line of the 
 whole block: long sessions over 90 min are what preserve running economy
  under fatigue\, which is the 70.3 run leg in one sentence.\n56 days to 
 Egmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
