DTSTAMP:20260909T190549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:Easy 6 km\, talk test (55 min)
DESCRIPTION:Easy 6 km\, talk test. Warm up 15 min + strides finishing AT 
 goal pace and no faster.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 - Re-entry\nRE-ENTRY. Vertical 
 jump stays depressed ~18 days after an ultra\, so this is easy running a
 nd nothing else. Durability is the through-line of the whole block: long
  sessions over 90 min are what preserve running economy under fatigue\, 
 which is the 70.3 run leg in one sentence.\n54 days to Egmond 10.5 km / 
 Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:egmond105kmvenicebase-w1-s3-cycling@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260909T190549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261119
SUMMARY:○ BIKE 30 min
DESCRIPTION:BIKE 30 min - sweet spot\, 3 x 10-12 min at 88-93% FTP (~132-
 140 W)\, 5 min easy between. The 90 km bike is over half a 70.3 by time.
 \n\nWeek 1 of 11 - Re-entry\nRE-ENTRY. Vertical jump stays depressed ~18
  days after an ultra\, so this is easy running and nothing else. Durabil
 ity is the through-line of the whole block: long sessions over 90 min ar
 e what preserve running economy under fatigue\, which is the 70.3 run le
 g in one sentence.\n53 days to Egmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:egmond105kmvenicebase-w1-s4-swim@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260909T190549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261119
SUMMARY:≈ SWIM LESSON (1-on-1\, 45 min). Book 6-10 of these
DESCRIPTION:SWIM LESSON (1-on-1\, 45 min). Book 6-10 of these - highest-R
 OI line item in the whole season. You cannot self-coach a catch you have
  never felt.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 - Re-entry\nRE-ENTRY. Vertical jump stays d
 epressed ~18 days after an ultra\, so this is easy running and nothing e
 lse. Durability is the through-line of the whole block: long sessions ov
 er 90 min are what preserve running economy under fatigue\, which is the
  70.3 run leg in one sentence.\n53 days to Egmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:egmond105kmvenicebase-w1-s5-legs@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260909T190549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:◆ Strength LOWER (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:Strength LOWER - HEAVY\, 45 min. Trap-bar deadlift 4 x 3 at 8
 8-92% 1RM (from 85 x 5 at 2 RIR your 1RM is ~105 kg\, so work at 92-97 k
 g - autoregulate\, add 2.5 kg when the last triple moves well). Then Bul
 garian split squat 3 x 5/leg heavy\, and calf raises 3 x 8 loaded. COMPL
 EX PAIRING: after each heavy set\, 5 box jumps or 20 m of bounds within 
 2 min - heavy resistance plus plyo beats either alone for running econom
 y. Heavy loads at or above 90% 1RM give greater economy gains than light
 er ones\, and the effect needs 10-14 weeks\, which is exactly this block
 . LOWER-LEG AND FOOT\, 5 min: tibialis anterior raises 3 x 15-20\, heel 
 walks 2 x 20 m\, eccentric dorsiflexion 3 x 10\, short-foot holds 3 x 30
  s per side.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 - Re-entry\nRE-ENTRY. Vertical jump stays d
 epressed ~18 days after an ultra\, so this is easy running and nothing e
 lse. Durability is the through-line of the whole block: long sessions ov
 er 90 min are what preserve running economy under fatigue\, which is the
  70.3 run leg in one sentence.\n52 days to Egmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:egmond105kmvenicebase-w1-s6-push@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260909T190549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
SUMMARY:Strength UPPER (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:Strength UPPER - push and pull as one session\, 45 min. Rows\
 , pull-ups\, overhead press\, rear delts. Heavy\, 4-6 reps\, not hypertr
 ophy ranges. Free against the running and cycling load. Dead hangs 3 x m
 ax at the end - grip is a genuine weakness at 32-36 s.\n\nWeek 1 of 11 -
  Re-entry\nRE-ENTRY. Vertical jump stays depressed ~18 days after an ult
 ra\, so this is easy running and nothing else. Durability is the through
 -line of the whole block: long sessions over 90 min are what preserve ru
 nning economy under fatigue\, which is the 70.3 run leg in one sentence.
 \n55 days to Egmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
