BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:egmond105kmvenicebase-w3-s0-long@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260909T190549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261130
SUMMARY:▲ Long easy run 10 km\, HR under 155. Aerobic base…
DESCRIPTION:Long easy run 10 km\, HR under 155. Aerobic base is the lever
  - the fastest runners get there on Zone 1 volume.\n\nWeek 3 of 11 - Thr
 eshold\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nTHRESHOLD BLOCK 
 opens. Pfitzinger's order: threshold first\, VO2max later as the race ap
 proaches. Two quality touches a week - Tuesday's session and a threshold
  finish on the long run. Quality volume stays inside 20-25% of weekly mi
 leage\, which is the Norwegian rule and the one that keeps this repeatab
 le.\n42 days to Egmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
