DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:THRESHOLD 4 x 1 km at threshold EFFORT (55 min)
DESCRIPTION:THRESHOLD 4 x 1 km at threshold EFFORT - HR 172-178\, which i
 s 95-98% of your measured LTHR of 181. Provisional pace 5:35-5:50/km\; r
 e-anchor off the retest and do not chase a number that predates it\, 90 
 s jog. First quality session of the block - deliberately conservative. W
 arm up 15 min + 4 x 100 m AT 5:15/km and no faster. Warm up 15 min\, coo
 l down 10 min.\n\nWeek 3 of 11 - Threshold\nTHRESHOLD BLOCK opens. Pfitz
 inger's order: threshold first\, VO2max later as the race approaches. Tw
 o quality touches a week - Tuesday's session and a threshold finish on t
 he long run. Quality volume stays inside 20-25% of weekly mileage\, whic
 h is the Norwegian rule and the one that keeps this repeatable.\n40 days
  to Egmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
