 eshold\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nTHRESHOLD. Sub-t
 hreshold means controlled\, not max. If you cannot finish the last rep a
 t the same pace as the first\, you ran the first too fast.\n35 days to E
 gmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
