 0 s jog. Controlled\, not max. Ceiling as well as target: if HR drifts p
 ast 183 on the last two\, you started too fast. Warm up 15 min\, cool do
 wn 10 min.\n\nWeek 4 of 11 - Threshold\nTHRESHOLD. Sub-threshold means c
 ontrolled\, not max. If you cannot finish the last rep at the same pace 
 as the first\, you ran the first too fast.\n33 days to Egmond 10.5 km / 
