DESCRIPTION:Swim 45 min - 400 m continuous\n\nWeek 7 of 11 - Sharpen\nSHA
 RPEN. VO2max enters now the race is close - 3-5 min efforts\, the range 
 where you accumulate real time at maximal oxygen uptake. Biggest running
  week of the block.\n14 days to Egmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
