DTSTAMP:20260909T190549Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261229
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261230
SUMMARY:VO2MAX 5 x 3 min at VO2max EFFORT (12 km)
DESCRIPTION:VO2MAX 5 x 3 min at VO2max EFFORT - provisional pace 5:05-5:2
 0/km\, HR at the END of each rep 186-193. HR lags 60-90 s so it cannot s
 teer a 3 min rep\; set it by pace\, confirm by the HR you finish on\, 2 
 min jog. Three to five minutes is the range that accumulates real time a
 t VO2max. PACE CEILING 5:00 - going faster shortens the session\, it doe
 s not improve it. Warm up 15 min\, cool down 10 min.\n\nWeek 7 of 11 - S
 harpen\nSHARPEN. VO2max enters now the race is close - 3-5 min efforts\,
  the range where you accumulate real time at maximal oxygen uptake. Bigg
 est running week of the block.\n12 days to Egmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
