DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270110
SUMMARY:○ BIKE 55 min zone 2\, HR under 145\, steady.…
DESCRIPTION:BIKE 55 min zone 2\, HR under 145\, steady. Non-impact aerobi
 c volume - the cheapest fitness available and it spares the shins.\n\nWe
 ek 8 of 11 - Sharpen\nSHARPEN then taper. Volume down 15%\, intensity he
 ld. Egmond is Sunday of next week.\n1 days to Egmond 10.5 km / Venice ba
 se.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
