 mpact\, so it costs the legs nothing and keeps Friday a genuine rest day
 .\n\nWeek 8 of 11 - Sharpen\nSHARPEN then taper. Volume down 15%\, inten
 sity held. Egmond is Sunday of next week.\n5 days to Egmond 10.5 km / Ve
 nice base.
