SUMMARY:⚑ EGMOND 10.5 km
DESCRIPTION:EGMOND 10.5 km - Egmond aan Zee\, Boulevard Noord. Beach\, du
 nes\, soft sand\, wind\, the Bloedweg. Run it by effort\, not pace: the 
 sand makes pace meaningless. This is the block's target and a hard aerob
 ic race\, not a PB attempt.\n\nWeek 9 of 11 - Race\nEGMOND 10.5 km Sunda
 y. Beach\, dunes\, soft sand. Then recover - the week after a race is no
 t a training week.\n0 days to Egmond 10.5 km / Venice base.
